title: 'pallet-collective: release stale proposal costs before re-proposing'
doc:
  - audience: [Runtime Dev, Runtime User]
    description: |
      Release any consideration retained for a retired proposal before
      recording a new proposer's consideration when the same motion is
      re-proposed. This prevents the original proposer's held deposit from
      being stranded. No storage migration is required.
crates:
  - name: pallet-collective
    bump: patch
